        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 83214,
        "area_px": 423808,
        "density": 0.19635,
        "chars": 793,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.53
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        311,
        1530,
        1545,
        1763
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. **Board Membership.** The Board shall be composed of the\nfollowing members, appointed by the Mayor: A lawyer with a criminal law\nbackground; two pathologists, one with a background or experience with forensic\npathology; three other members whose background or professional qualifications\nare to be determined by the Mayor. In addition, the Health Commissioner of the\nCity of New York shall serve _ex officio_. From among the members, the Mayor\nshall designate a Chairperson.",
